      "content": "but there is no one to reach out to. that's the thing. everyone who used to be there is on the other side of it. if i talk to a counselor it's just gonna be some stranger who doesn't get it, and if i talk to anyone else i'm just reminding them of why they hate me. the silence is just... it's permanent. like there's no version of my life where this doesn't define me forever. it just feels like the social part of me is just gone for good.",
